     "body": "<p>The <tt>POST</tt> documentation looks very good. Could you please do something similar for <tt>PUT</tt>?<br/>\n<a href=\"https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FEDORA4x/RESTful+HTTP+API+-+Containers#RESTfulHTTPAPI-Containers-YellowPUTCreatearesourcewithaspecifiedpath,orreplacethetriplesassociatedwitharesourcewiththetriplesprovidedintherequestbody\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FEDORA4x/RESTful+HTTP+API+-+Containers#RESTfulHTTPAPI-Containers-YellowPUTCreatearesourcewithaspecifiedpath,orreplacethetriplesassociatedwitharesourcewiththetriplesprovidedintherequestbody</a>.</p>",
