  "description": "<p>This is a documentation task following on from the work of:<br/>\n<a href=\"https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-1468\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-1468</a></p>\n\n<p>This task is to update the 4.x user documentation to note that the \"checksum\" query parameter has been deprecated and detailing how to use the new RFC-3230 approach.<br/>\n<a href=\"https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FEDORA4x/RESTful+HTTP+API+-+Containers\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FEDORA4x/RESTful+HTTP+API+-+Containers</a></p>",
